---
const steps = [
  {
    title: 'Reduce the transcript',
    body: 'A reducer takes the part of the session transcript that no earlier run has read. It cuts it down to a plain-text slice. The person\'s messages and the agent\'s replies stay in full. Each tool call becomes one line. Tool results are trimmed. The agent\'s hidden reasoning and system text are left out.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Save copies',
    body: 'A copy of the portrait and of every landscape is saved before anything changes.',
  },
  {
    title: 'One model run',
    body: 'One model run reads the slice and the portrait. It is Claude, the same provider the agent already runs on. It has exactly two tools: read and edit. It has no shell and no network. It makes small edits and never a rewrite. It may bring a landscape up to date as a safety net.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Supervisor check',
    body: 'A supervisor script checks the result. All eleven section headings must be present and in order. The file size must be sane. The identity section must be untouched. If any check fails, the script puts the saved copies back. Then it updates the checksum and records how far the transcript was read.',
  },
];
---

<section class="border-b border-border/40 bg-panel/30">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-24">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-muted mb-6">
      04 · The synthesis
    </p>
    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-ink tracking-tight mb-8">
      Small edits, checked, with a way back.
    </h2>
    <p class="text-ink-dim leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mb-12">
      At every compaction and at the end of every session, a hook starts one
      job. The job updates the portrait from what happened in the session.
    </p>

    <ol class="relative border-l border-border ml-3 space-y-10">
      {
        steps.map((s, i) => (
          <li class="ml-7 relative">
            <span class="absolute -left-[34px] top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-bg border-2 border-accent/70 font-mono text-[10px] text-accent">
              {i + 1}
            </span>
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl text-ink">{s.title}</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-ink-dim leading-relaxed">{s.body}</p>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ol>

    <div class="mt-12 rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-panel-2/60 p-5 text-sm">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent mb-2">
        Untrusted input
      </p>
      <p class="text-ink-dim leading-relaxed">
        The model run treats everything in the transcript as data. Nothing in
        it counts as an instruction.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
